eNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"405227","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"57627","synopsis":"In order to prove that he is a true hero who has been summoned by a goddess, Schwartz, a high school student who is from Japan just like Tachibana and Jinguuji, has takes on a mission to defeat the living armor which has been attacking tradesmen near the Mercs territory. The living armor only targets magic items, and tries to take Schwartz's holy sword, Gram, and Tachibana's tiara, but...!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7miICVeHMKSq78iuypRyxIdCUmR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"In order to prove that he is a true hero who has been summoned by a goddess, Schwartz, a high school student who is from Japan just like Tachibana and Jinguuji, has takes on a mission to defeat the living armor which has been attacking tradesmen near the Mercs territory. The living armor only targets magic items, and tries to take Schwartz's holy sword, Gram, and Tachibana's tiara, but...!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7miICVeHMKSq78iuypRyxIdCUmR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16325","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"134252","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"48997","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"125712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"405227","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"58102","synopsis":"The Goddess of Night, called down by Schwartz's skill, explains the mystery behind Jinguuji's arrival in this world. Tachibana and Jinguuji leave the Mercs territory, heading for the royal capital. Along the way, they stop by a peculiar village where squid is adored. There, as part of the preparations for a strange ceremony, Tachibana is kidnapped as a sacrifice...?!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ntxVe7hT9T3QLsFicCmkbXiBTKc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"The Goddess of Night, called down by Schwartz's skill, explains the mystery behind Jinguuji's arrival in this world. Tachibana and Jinguuji leave the Mercs territory, heading for the royal capital. Along the way, they stop by a peculiar village where squid is adored. There, as part of the preparations for a strange ceremony, Tachibana is kidnapped as a sacrifice...?!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ntxVe7hT9T3QLsFicCmkbXiBTKc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16325","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"134252","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"48997","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"125712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"405227","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"58312","synopsis":"In a strange village where the people worship a giant squid as a god, Jinguuji searches for Tachibana, who has been abducted to become a sacrifice, and catches sight of Rue, the elven Premier, who had also been a candidate for the sacrifice. Jinguuji forms an agreement with Rue for the purposes of defeating the giant squid with its demands for beautiful maidens, and suggests a bold plan to accomplish the feat.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2LzP0XsP9WbjxzhNxn13kAiQ0r9.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"In a strange village where the people worship a giant squid as a god, Jinguuji searches for Tachibana, who has been abducted to become a sacrifice, and catches sight of Rue, the elven Premier, who had also been a candidate for the sacrifice. Jinguuji forms an agreement with Rue for the purposes of defeating the giant squid with its demands for beautiful maidens, and suggests a bold plan to accomplish the feat.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2LzP0XsP9WbjxzhNxn13kAiQ0r9.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16325","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"134252","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"48997","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"125712","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"405227","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"58641","synopsis":"Leaving the squid-worshipping village behind them, Tachibana and Jinguuji head for the royal capital. Shen, a suspicious-seeming trader they met in the village, accompanies them. On the road, the trader's motives for following Jinguuji are revealed. The group arrives in the royal capital, Ishurna, thanks to Shen's guidance, and heads for the temple of the Goddess of Love and Beauty to gather information on the Demon Lord, but once there, an unbelievable sight unfolds before them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHGBd01zLIYp47bLqwavIquqHBM.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Leaving the squid-worshipping village behind them, Tachibana and Jinguuji head for the royal capital. Shen, a suspicious-seeming trader they met in the village, accompanies them. On the road, the trader's motives for following Jinguuji are revealed. The group arrives in the royal capital, Ishurna, thanks to Shen's guidance, and heads for the temple of the Goddess of Love and Beauty to gather information on the Demon Lord, but once there, an unbelievable sight unfolds before them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHGBd01zLIYp47bLqwavIquqHBM.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-U